# ── C++ / C# / 脚本仍按各自平台处理 ──
*.cs   text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.sln  text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf

# ── 纯二进制且不走 LFS 的文件（明确标记，避免 Git 尝试 diff）──
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.lib  binary
*.pdb  binary
*.so   binary
*.dylib binary
*.pak  binary
*.ucas binary
*.utoc binary